            <note corresp="#d147-f1" n="0" type="source" xml:id="d147-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 761.00/1-1862. Confidential. Drafted
                    by Valdes on January 25, cleared by
                        Guthrie and Bohlen, and approved by Kohler. Repeated to Moscow and Paris.</p>
